   "native_decoder": "Read complete_parent_assembly.word in order as layers; center their summed full thicknesses in z. Read each layer.rows.word in order as complete module rows, centered together in y. A row has module_count identical whole-patch modules centered in x, spaced by its full width. For each module(a,b), center its honeycomb patch by(3(a-1)/4,sqrt(3)*(b-1+epsilon/2)/2,0), then place owner(u,v)at(3u/2,sqrt(3)*(v+(u mod2)/2),0)minus that midpoint. Apply the stored proper module quaternion and add the module center. Keep exactly retained_owner_words; multiply all final centers by1.0000001 and inflate the common nominal host scale by that factor plus1e-7.",
